# Mycodo Hermes Skill Crontab Example
# Standard Linux crontab entries for the mycodo decision engine
# and follow-up checker. Adjust paths to match your installation.
#
# Install with: crontab -e
# Verify with:  crontab -l

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CORE: Decision Engine (30-minute cycle)
# The primary environmental control loop. Reads sensors, evaluates
# conditions against species thresholds, fires actuator commands.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*/30 * * * * python3 $HOME/mycodo/mycodo_skill/decision_engine.py --species lions_mane --phase fruiting --auto-phase --execute --camera --html --html-dir $HOME/mycodo/reports/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CORE: Adaptive Follow-Up Checker (10-minute cycle)
# Zero-cost verification that actuator actions produced the
# expected environmental change. Runs as pure shell script —
# no LLM tokens consumed. Only alerts on failure.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*/10 * * * * bash $HOME/mycodo/scripts/mycodo-followup-wrapper.sh

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: Scheduled Sensor Checks
# Provide baseline readings for trend analysis and audits.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Morning sensor snapshot (6:00 AM)
0 6 * * * bash $HOME/mycodo/scripts/sensor-query.sh snapshot > $HOME/mycodo/sensor-data/raw/sensor-overnight.md

# Afternoon sensor snapshot (3:00 PM)
0 15 * * * bash $HOME/mycodo/scripts/sensor-query.sh snapshot > $HOME/mycodo/sensor-data/raw/sensor-pm-fetch.md

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL: Contamination Reddit Fetch (daily)
# Pulls contamination-related posts from mushroom subreddits.
# See contamination/README.md for details.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
0 10 * * * python3 $HOME/mycodo/contamination/reddit-fetch-parser.py --out $HOME/mycodo/contamination-data/contamination-fetch.md --days 7

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DIRECTORY SETUP (run once before enabling cron jobs):
#
#   mkdir -p $HOME/mycodo/sensor-data/raw \
#            $HOME/mycodo/sensor-data/snapshots \
#            $HOME/mycodo/reports/ \
#            $HOME/mycodo/contamination-data/
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
